{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"Serverless.Serverless","latestVersion":"3.39.0","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"Build applications on AWS Lambda and other next-gen cloud services, that auto-scale and only charge you when they run.","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://www.serverless.com/legal/terms","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Build applications on AWS Lambda and other next-gen cloud services, that auto-scale and only charge you when they run.","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://www.serverless.com/legal/terms","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"The Serverless Framework is a command-line tool that uses easy and approachable YAML syntax to deploy both your code and cloud infrastructure needed to make tons of serverless application use-cases. It's a multi-language framework that supports Node.js, Typescript, Python, Go, Java, and more. It's also completely extensible via over 1,000 plugins that can add more serverless use-cases and workflows to the Framework.","name":"Serverless Framework","packageUrl":"https://www.serverless.com/framework","publisher":"Serverless","publisherUrl":"https://www.serverless.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/serverless/serverless/releases/tag/v3.39.0","tags":["aws-lambda","azure-functions","google-cloud-functions"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"快速部署你的 Serverless 应用，支持事件触发，弹性扩缩容，并且按需付费。","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://cn.serverless.com/legal/terms","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Serverless Framework 是一个命令行工具，它使用基于事件触发的计算资源，例如腾讯云云函数 SCF、AWS Lambda 等。此外，Serverless Framework 为开发和部署 Serverless 架构提供脚手架，自动化工作流以及最佳实践。并且它支持通过丰富的插件进行功能扩展。","name":"Serverless Framework","packageUrl":"https://cn.serverless.com/cli","publisher":"Serverless","publisherUrl":"https://cn.serverless.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/serverless/serverless/releases/tag/v3.39.0","tags":["云函数"]}},"longDescription":"The Serverless Framework is a command-line tool that uses easy and approa